:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Wyvern (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Wyvern''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Wyvern
|image = E 097.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}


==Enemy==
Pretty much a stronger [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]]. Has very high health, damage per hit, and outranges most non-[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] cats, but sluggish speed and attack rate.

